  "details": "Description\n\nStarting maybe a year ago, the VRChat Home world's music playlist near the spawnpoint has ceased to play any audio at all, or apparently load music at all. This has persisted through reinstalling the game, across different platforms (Windows AND Linux), and any lineup of settings I can think of. Music works fine anywhere else.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nLaunch the VRChat Home world, and try tinkering with the playlist buttons. I'm pretty sure it's the latest version of said world.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: World\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1885-81193b80fa-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-12_20-35-25.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_69170c6b-176b-4e40-8652-ba66f280187e/1/file)",
